{"sha": "ffa6ffd31a89ad42e2fe5cfbb741488a6faa9c0a3db9aaf12ab3ae5c29f55f68", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:crystals-metals} 章 --- 晶体 I：理想晶体与金属}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:1}", "简单立方：$8 \\times \\frac18 = 1$ 个原子，配位数为 6。体心立方：$8 \\times", "\\frac18 + 1 = 2$，配位数为 8。面心立方：$8 \\times \\frac18 + 6 \\times", "\\frac12 = 4$，配位数为 12。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:2}", "原子沿棱相接：$a = 2R$，$Z = 1$，$C = \\frac43\\pi R^3/(2R)^3", "= \\pi/6 \\approx 0.52$，小于体心立方（0.68）和面心立方（0.74）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:3}", "$R = a\\sqrt2/4 = 405.0 \\times 0.3536 = \\qty{143.2}{pm}$；", "$\\rho = 4 \\times 26.98/(6.022 \\times 10^{23} \\times (4.050 \\times", "10^{-8})^3) = \\qty{2.70}{g/cm^3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:4}", "$R = a\\sqrt3/4 = \\qty{185.8}{pm}$；$\\rho = 2 \\times 22.99/(6.022 \\times", "10^{23} \\times (4.291 \\times 10^{-8})^3) = \\qty{0.966}{g/cm^3}$，与", "实测值 \\qty{0.97}{g/cm^3} 相符。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:5}", "$a^3 = 4M/(\\rho N_A) = 4 \\times 107.87/(10.50 \\times 6.022 \\times 10^{23}) =", "\\qty{6.824e-23}{cm^3}$，故 $a = \\qty{4.086e-8}{cm} = \\qty{408.6}{pm}$，且", "$R = a\\sqrt2/4 = \\qty{144.5}{pm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:6}", "证明与\\cref{prop:b1:crystals-metals:hcp}相同。镁：", "$c/a = 521.0/320.9 = 1.624$。棱柱体积为", "$\\frac{3\\sqrt3}{2}a^2c$，含 6 个原子，故 $\\rho = 6M/(N_A \\cdot", "\\frac{3\\sqrt3}{2}a^2c) = 6 \\times 24.31/(6.022 \\times 10^{23} \\times", "2.598 \\times (3.209 \\times 10^{-8})^2 \\times 5.210 \\times 10^{-8}) =", "\\qty{1.74}{g/cm^3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:7}", "原子：$(0,0,0)$，$(\\frac a2,\\frac a2,0)$，$(\\frac a2,0,\\frac a2)$，", "$(0,\\frac a2,\\frac a2)$。八面体间隙：$(\\frac a2,\\frac a2,\\frac a2)$，", "$(\\frac a2,0,0)$，$(0,\\frac a2,0)$，$(0,0,\\frac a2)$。四面体间隙：", "8 个点，其坐标各为 $\\frac a4$ 或 $\\frac{3a}{4}$。", "每个原子对应一个八面体间隙和两个四面体间隙。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:8}", "$R(\\ce{Cu}) = 361.5\\sqrt2/4 = \\qty{127.8}{pm}$，$R(\\ce{Ni}) = 352.4\\sqrt2/4", "= \\qty{124.6}{pm}$：半径相差不超过 3\\,\\%，结构相同，故", "两者中任一原子都可占据另一原子在晶格中的位置。氢原子小得多，", "只能位于间隙位置，形成间隙型合金。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:9}", "$R = 316.5\\sqrt3/4 = \\qty{137.0}{pm}$；$\\rho = 2 \\times 183.84/(6.022 \\times", "10^{23} \\times (3.165 \\times 10^{-8})^3) = \\qty{19.26}{g/cm^3}$；每", "\\unit{cm^3} 中的原子数：$2/a^3 = 2/(3.165 \\times 10^{-8})^3 = \\num{6.31e22}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:10}", "面心 $(\\frac a2,\\frac a2,0)$ 到上、下相邻晶胞体心的距离均为 $a/2$：", "$r_O = \\frac a2 - R = \\frac a2 - \\frac{a\\sqrt3}{4}", "= \\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{4}a$。点 $(\\frac a2,\\frac a4,0)$ 到角顶和体心的", "距离均为 $\\sqrt{a^2/4 + a^2/16} = \\frac{a\\sqrt5}{4}$，即角顶 $(0,0,0)$ 和", "$(a,0,0)$ 以及体心 $(\\frac a2,\\frac a2,\\pm\\frac a2)$：", "$r_T = \\frac{\\sqrt5 - \\sqrt3}{4}a$。代入 $a = 4R/\\sqrt3$：", "$r_O = \\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{\\sqrt3}R = 0.155\\,R$，且", "$r_T = \\frac{\\sqrt5-\\sqrt3}{\\sqrt3}R = 0.291\\,R$。体心立方中，四面体间隙", "是较大者。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:11}", "$C = Z\\cdot\\frac43\\pi R^3/a^3$，且 $Z/a^3 = \\rho N_A/M$，故 $C =", "\\frac{4\\pi R^3\\rho N_A}{3M} = \\frac{\\pi\\rho N_A}{6M}(2R)^3$。铜：", "$\\pi \\times 8.93 \\times 6.022 \\times 10^{23}/(6 \\times 63.55) \\times (2.556", "\\times 10^{-8})^3 = 0.740$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:crystals-metals:12}", "$a \\approx (407.8 + 408.6)/2 = \\qty{408.2}{pm}$；平均摩尔质量 $(196.97 +", "107.87)/2 = \\qty{152.42}{g/mol}$；$\\rho = 4 \\times 152.42/(6.022 \\times", "10^{23} \\times (4.082 \\times 10^{-8})^3) = \\qty{14.9}{g/cm^3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:crystals-metals:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $Z = 2$；配位数为 8。", "\\textbf{2.} 沿体对角线：$a\\sqrt3 = 4R$，$R = 286.65 \\times", "\\sqrt3/4 = \\qty{124.1}{pm}$。", "\\textbf{3.} $\\rho = 2 \\times 55.845/(6.022 \\times 10^{23} \\times (2.8665", "\\times 10^{-8})^3) = \\qty{7.87}{g/cm^3}$。", "\\textbf{4.} $2/a^3 = 2/(2.8665 \\times 10^{-8})^3 = \\num{8.49e22}$ 个原子。", "\\textbf{5.} $C = \\pi\\sqrt3/8 = 0.680$。", "\\textbf{6.} 计算与测量的密度在三位有效数字内相符。", "\\textbf{7.} $\\alpha$：$R = 289.8\\sqrt3/4 = \\qty{125.5}{pm}$；$\\gamma$：", "$R = 363.9\\sqrt2/4 = \\qty{128.7}{pm}$。", "\\textbf{8.} $\\alpha$：$a^3/2 = \\qty{12.17e6}{pm^3}$ 每个原子；$\\gamma$：", "$a^3/4 = \\qty{12.05e6}{pm^3}$ 每个原子。", "\\textbf{9.} $\\gamma$ 更致密：$\\rho_\\alpha = 55.845/(6.022 \\times 10^{23}", "\\times 1.217 \\times 10^{-23}) = \\qty{7.62}{g/cm^3}$，$\\rho_\\gamma =", "\\qty{7.70}{g/cm^3}$。", "\\textbf{10.} $(12.05 - 12.17)/12.17 = -1.0\\,\\%$：加热经过转变时，棒材", "收缩约 1\\,\\%。", "\\textbf{11.} 是：面心立方更紧密（0.74 对 0.68），这一点足以抵消", "较大原子半径：$(0.680/0.740) \\times (128.7/125.5)^3 = 0.99$。", "\\textbf{12.} $r_C = a\\sqrt3/8 = 356.68 \\times 0.2165 = \\qty{77.2}{pm}$。", "\\textbf{13.} $r_O = 0.0670 \\times 289.8 = \\qty{19.4}{pm}$。", "\\textbf{14.} $r_T = 0.1260 \\times 289.8 = \\qty{36.5}{pm}$。", "\\textbf{15.} 碳（\\qty{77}{pm}）的尺寸是最大间隙位置的两倍：", "相邻的铁原子必须被推开。", "\\textbf{16.} 畸变需要消耗大量能量，因此只有极少数碳原子", "进入 $\\alpha$-铁。", "\\textbf{17.} 每个含 4 个原子的晶胞中有 4 个八面体间隙，即每个铁原子一个。", "\\textbf{18.} $r_T = (\\sqrt{3/2} - 1) \\times 128.7 = \\qty{28.9}{pm}$。", "\\textbf{19.} 每个铁原子对应一个碳原子：\\ce{FeC}，$w(\\ce{C}) = 12.011/(55.845 +", "12.011) = 17.7\\,\\%$。", "\\textbf{20.} 每十个铁原子对应一个碳原子：$w = 12.011/(558.45 + 12.011) =", "2.1\\,\\%$。", "\\textbf{21.} $\\gamma$-铁的八面体间隙远大于", "$\\alpha$-铁的任一间隙位置：高温铁溶解碳，淬火随即将其", "截留。", "\\textbf{22.} $r_O = (\\sqrt2 - 1) \\times 128.7 = \\textbf{\\qty{53}{pm}}$，", "是铁中最大的空穴，仍小于碳原子（\\qty{77}{pm}）：", "碳溶于高温铁中，但会使其膨胀。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}